{
  "description": "PENDING owner decision (feedback-network fast-math noise: the port is bit-identical to the no-fast-math reference, which misses module_defaults here), see LEDGER.md 2026-10-21 M6 PR 2. Not loaded by the harness (only modules/<area>/*.json is). To re-enable, move these cases into ../reverb_module.json and write hashes.",
